                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "As the co-chair of the Congressional Public Health Caucus, I'm working to reduce barriers to care in rural communities by expanding telemedicine and investing in lifesaving cures. \n\nOn #NationalRuralHealthDay, we recognize the efforts of healthcare providers who care for the 61 million Americans living in rural areas.",
