                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Advanced Career Education (ACE) Center at Hermitage High School offers hands-on, skills-based training for @HenricoSchools juniors and seniors, leading to licensure or certification in fields like construction, healthcare, transportation, and public safety.\n\nI enjoyed touring their state-of-the-art facility and speaking with bright students about my bipartisan Freedom to Invest in Tomorrow\u2019s Workforce Act. It\u2019s wonderful to see the next generation preparing for in-demand careers!",
