                "text": "As a @VCU alum myself and co-chair of the Congressional Public Health Caucus, I always appreciate the chance to speak with Dr. Marlon Levy of @VCUHealth. \n\nWe discussed federal legislation to protect healthcare workers and how to reduce barriers to healthcare. https://t.co/Yce6S0PTlm",
