                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Before coming to Congress, I earned a master\u2019s degree in public health. My educational background taught me how much of an impact federal healthcare policy has on surgery centers.\n\nI learned so much during my tour of the Virginia Cardiovascular Specialists' Heart & Vascular Center in Henrico and enjoyed discussing pertinent federal legislation with their impressive team!",
