                "text": "I joined @CBS6 to address the troubling situation at the Colonial Heights facility.\n\nOur seniors deserve better, and I\u2019m calling for full transparency and accountability to ensure Medicare dollars are spent on the quality care they\u2019ve earned. https://t.co/aVaqY3wAUi",
