                "text": "Social Security and Medicare are not entitlements\u2014they are earned benefits tied to a lifetime of work.\n\nToday I convened a roundtable to hear directly from those who rely on these programs, and to discuss meaningful ways to protect and modernize them. \n\nMore: https://t.co/RiajAghtL4",
