                "text": "Today I voted to deliver real results for Virginians\u2014lowering taxes, protecting Medicaid, investing in rural schools, and boosting our national defense.\n\nIt\u2019s a strong step toward a more secure and affordable future.\n\nMy full statement\u2b07\ufe0f\nhttps://t.co/P0khMwHBON",
