                "text": "H.R. 1 will strengthen, secure, and sustain Medicaid for our most vulnerable communities, such as pregnant women, single mothers, children, seniors, and people with disabilities. This legislation roots out waste, fraud, and abuse by removing people from the program who are ineligible - including deceased beneficiaries, those enrolled in multiple states, and illegal immigrants.",
